<h2>Overview</h2>
<p>
  The <strong>Blue Marloc Main</strong> module provides a central entry point for
  all Blue Marloc functionality. It creates the admin menu structure and groups
  related tools under Administration, Entity, Data production, and Management.
</p>

<h2>Features</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Top-level “Blue Marloc” menu under Administration</li>
  <li>Submenu containers for different areas</li>
  <li>Landing pages that auto-list child tools</li>
</ul>
